\par\par \b \uc2  Shekel weakens on Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 210 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Februar 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TEL AVIV, Feb 6 (Reuter) - The shekel weakened mildly against the dollar and basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Israel intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  more aggressively than usual to support the dollar, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Operators continued to convert dollars into shekels to take advantage of high domestic interest rates. \par \par \uc2  "Trading volume was average but today was different because of the aggressive nature of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Ron Bedny of Bank Discount. \par \par \uc2  "The bank was not merely acting to keep the shekel-dollar balanced but actively sought to bring the shekel exchange rate to 3.0210 per dollar by buying up excess dollars. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  even created a shortage of dollars in the morning," he said. \par \par \uc2  The shekel closed the daily tender at 3.0210 shekels per dollar against Friday's rate of 3.0110. The basket closed at 3.3813 shekels per basket unit against 3.3802 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses the shekel traded against the yen at 3.0362 shekels per 100 yen against 3.0235 on Friday and against the mark at 1.9766 shekels per mark from 1.9836 on Friday. \par \par \uc2  In late afternoon the dollar was trading at 3.0226 shekels. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr2600g34\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
